# ── Documentation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NO .md file is ever tracked (2026-10-02, owner's instruction). Every doc stays
# local: SPEC.md, constitution.md, AGENTS.md, DEVELOPMENT.md, dossiers. They name
# the VPS IP, the deploy paths and the mail host, and this repository is PUBLIC
# (confirmed via the GitHub API: "visibility": "public").
# The former `!AGENTS.md` / `!.github/copilot-instructions.md` exceptions are gone
# and both files were un-tracked; the rules live on disk + Obsidian + Engram.
# Verify after any edit:  git ls-files '*.md'  must print nothing.
# Enforced automatically by the pre-commit hook in tools/git-hooks/pre-commit.

# Files that already leaked an address or a secret into the public history once.
# Never re-add them, in any form (see SECURITY-ROTATION.md).
PRODUCTION_ENV_TEMPLATE.md
find-orphan.sh
pull-logs.sh
fix-db.sh

